parameters {

/* NOTE ( pStartPop, EN )
>Data Source: CCHS cycle 1.1 (2000-2001)
>SAS Program: 	MakeStartPop_POHEM8210_DH.sas 
>Folder :	M:\03 Microdata_Programs\POHEM_Startpop\2020-01-14CCHS2001_POHEMDementia\output


>=============

Updated March 2nd, 2021 by Deirdre Hennessy
Added dementia from unlocked PUMF 2001
>=============

Updated Jan 14th, 2020 by Deirdre Hennessy
Added dementia and copd as dummies

>=============

Updated June 22th, 2016 by Josee Frappier
Modification of calculation of packyears for smokertype3(min of 1 year of smoking to avoid packyears=0)
Age started smoking chaged from 52 to 50 for category  >50.

>=============

Updated June 6th, 2016 by Josee Frappier
addition of variables Height(meter) and Packyears

>=============
updated July 3,2015 by Claude N.
 - This StartPop is for POHEM 7100
 - Removed fruitvegDUMMY (dummy and not used) and PMDM_phys_diag_diab_imp (this is now imputed in POHEM)
 - cancer, cc_ex5 and 4 physical activity components are no longer dummy ==> number of records went from 105337 to 98458
 - Note that file now contains paca_time_leisure (continuous e.g. 0.45 hour/day) instead of paca_time_leisure_cat (4 categories)
=============
>=============
updated June 8,2015 by Claude N.
 - added 4 physical activity components (along with cancer and cc_ex5). All 6 components are dummied (to keep the same number of records).
 - removed 3 variables because they were duplicates of other variables. 
 - removed the region variable because it can be derived from the province variable.
 - No additional records removed.
 - This is only for POHEM 7050 which is simply a transient version of POHEM towards POHEM 7100.
=============
>=============
updated Feb 14,2014 by Deirdre H. : added SPoRT components.  No additional records removed.
=============
>=============
updated NOvember 08, 2013 by Claude N. : added HUI components.  Records with missing HUI removed.
=============
updated June 03, 208 by Claude N. : improved RACE and CULTORIG variables; reweighted sample wts.
=============
updated May 30 2008 
by Bill
Purpose: care has been taken to maintain as many records as possible, and to compromise for now on missing data
for alcohol and fruitveg specifically
>=============
>Database records from PUMF CCHS1.1 : 
	Before exclusions N=130880; 
	After  exclusions M=97919
>=============
>Maximum no. records 	A= 150000  (parameter dimension)
>Dummy records 		Y=  52081  (Y=A-M)
>Dummy values		-1	   (for all X variables)
>=============
>Example dummy record of X variables repeated Y times (placed at end of known data): 
<	(Y) { (X) -1, },
>=============
>See documenation: Initializing the simulation model of AMI (CCORT) from CCHS 2001.doc
*/

int pStartPopYear = {2001};

